# Railway Zero-Secrets Deployment Environment Variables
# 
# This file shows the minimal configuration needed for Railway deployment.
# Railway will automatically populate some of these values.

# CORE VARIABLES (Required - Railway auto-populates these)
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=${{RAILWAY_PUBLIC_DOMAIN}}
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_NAME=Next.js Starter

# OPTIONAL VARIABLES (Application works without these)
# Uncomment and add real values in Railway dashboard for full functionality

# SendGrid Email Integration (optional)
# Get API key from: https://sendgrid.com/
# EMAIL_FROM=your@email.com
# SENDGRID_API_KEY=SG.your_api_key_here

# Google reCAPTCHA v3 (optional)
# Get keys from: https://www.google.com/recaptcha/admin
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=your_site_key_here
# RECAPTCHA_SECRET_KEY=your_secret_key_here

# BEHAVIOR WITHOUT OPTIONAL VARIABLES:
# - Forms work but emails are logged to console instead of being sent
# - reCAPTCHA validation is skipped (forms still work)
# - All UI features remain functional
# - Perfect for demos, development, and testing
